007. AE = GE [10] & AF = GF [13] (SSS)⇒  ∠EAF = ∠FGE [14]
008. C,D,B are collinear [00] & DC = DB [01] ⇒  D is midpoint of CB [15]
009. D is midpoint of CB [15] & F is midpoint of BA [12] ⇒  DF ∥ CA [16]
010. D is midpoint of CB [15] & E is midpoint of CA [09] ⇒  DE ∥ BA [17]
011. ∠EAF = ∠FGE [14] & A,E,C are collinear [02] & A,F,B are collinear [04] & AC ∥ DF [16] & AB ∥ DE [17] ⇒  ∠FDE = ∠FGE
